---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Cadevue">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">About Me</h1>
  <p class="mt-6 text-ink-dim text-lg/relaxed font-body">
    There is a kind of quiet frustration that comes from feeling ordinary in spaces that do not see you. It is not loud, not dramatic, but it lingers. It shows up in comparisons, in doubts, in the constant questioning of self-worth. It makes a person wonder if there is something missing within them. When surrounded by people who seem to shine effortlessly, it becomes easy to believe that one simply does not have that same light. But what if the light was never absent — only hidden?
  </p>
</Base>
